            "line": 451,
            "text": "        This function first processes the input data batch through a conditioning workflow (`conditioner`) to obtain conditioned and unconditioned states. It then defines a nested function `velocity_fn` which applies a denoising operation on an input `noise_x` at a given noise level `sigma` using both the conditioned and unconditioned states."
